00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,278
Now follow water into a root.

2
00:00:02,278 --> 00:00:09,869
It enters through the root hairs, thin outgrowths of epidermal cells whose sap is more negative than the soil water.

3
00:00:09,869 --> 00:00:18,398
Soil might sit at minus zero point zero one five megapascal, a root hair at around minus zero point six, so water flows in.

